cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: dataset
title: "Niger Delta Contamination Risk Dataset"
abstract: >
  A spatially explicit contamination risk dataset for the Niger Delta, Nigeria,
  produced by the VRF computational environmental intelligence pipeline. Fuses
  peer-reviewed heavy metal measurements, UNEP Ogoniland assessment data,
  NOSDRA oil spill incident records, and Sentinel-2 NDVI indices into a
  Composite Risk Score (CRS) at 1km² resolution across Rivers, Bayelsa,
  Delta, Edo, Akwa Ibom, and Cross River States.
authors:
  - name: "Dickson Ojochogwu Dickson"
    website: "https://ojochogwu.dev/research"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-05-11"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/verdantafrica/niger-delta"
